   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-19, relayed by cloud/orch)**: « tu » everywhere. The app's voice becomes « tu » in every user-facing string (about 18 files say « vous » today), not « vous » as this issue first proposed. It is a deliberate difference from legacy (« vous »): the PR adds a `gap-new` or `gap-edit` ledger row with H.1 `b·operator`. Scheduled after the weekly quota reset (2026-11-22), under the reduced-parallelism rule of #893.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
